abstract: >-
  One-node k3d measurement rig for Paper 1 of Containing and Unwinding the
  Blast Radius of Agentic Workflows (ICSA artefact). ICSA revision tag
  v1.1-icsa-submission: profile long-multistep, modes flat and full, ten seeds,
  median [IQR] tables, plus gateway, sweep, evasion, re-declaration, and
  data-intensive cells. Nothing from Paper 2's hosted-LLM / multi-node surfaces
  is in this repository. The v1.1 software version DOI is recorded only after
  Zenodo mints it; do not invent one.
